            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li><strong>Feature:</strong> Errors now show in a clear banner you can dismiss. When a day is already submitted or approved, the banner links to the web timesheet.</li><li><strong>Feature:</strong> Days submitted for review are locked and marked with a Submitted badge.</li><li><strong>Feature:</strong> Time entered on the web appears in Today and History and counts toward your totals.</li><li><strong>Feature:</strong> Settings has a Quit Lola button.</li></ul>]]></description>
